<title>JAPAN: LUGE-WORLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>LUGE-WORLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NAGANO, Japan 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the final day</p>
<p>of a World Cup luge event on Sunday:</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p> 1. Wendel Suckow (U.S.)    1 minute 41.667 seconds (first run</p>
